WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.251 --> 00:00:02.836
Can I ask you a
question, Father?

00:00:04.588 --> 00:00:05.881
Do you know anything
about...

00:00:05.881 --> 00:00:06.882
La Llorona?

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:10.010
The weeping
woman.

00:00:12.513 --> 00:00:13.764
It's a folktale.

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:20.479
To some.

00:00:25.943 --> 00:00:27.694
Stay in the car,
okay?

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:29.112
And, please, don't wake
up your sister.

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:30.614
Oh, my God.

00:00:30.614 --> 00:00:32.448
No! No!

00:00:32.908 --> 00:00:34.493
It's your fault!

00:00:34.826 --> 00:00:36.370
I tried to stop her.

00:00:36.537 --> 00:00:38.080
Who did you try
to stop?

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:39.998
La Llorona.

00:01:14.366 --> 00:01:16.451
Sam! Sam, let
me in!

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.203
What's going on?

